# Keep specific CSVs if they are part of the base repo, but ignore generated ones.
# Actually, ignoring all zip and csv might be risky if the user wants to keep the players data.
# The user likely wants to keep the players data CSVs since they are explicitly in the root.
# So I will not ignore *.csv globally, but maybe in specific folders.
# data/archive.zip should probably be ignored if it's large, but the user might need it.
